<title>FRANCE: Reuters 3rd ex-Paris Americas air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 3rd ex-Paris Americas air cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are current average ex-Paris French franc air cargo rates per kilo for a 100kg shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>					May 28	    April 18</p>
<p>NORTH AMERICA</p>
<p>	 PAR-JFK		    5.60		  5.50</p>
<p>	 PAR-CHI		    6.10		  5.80</p>
<p>	 PAR-LAX		    6.75		  6.65</p>
<p>	 PAR-YMX		    6.75		  6.75</p>
<p>LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>	 PAR-MEX		   11.90		 11.90</p>
<p>	 PAR-SAO		   18.00		 18.00</p>
<p>The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents based at the Paris airports.</p>
<p>All prices are quoted in French francs.</p>
<p>The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
</text>
